        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Section 2.18 The Union agrees to cooperate with the Employer to advance its legitimate interests by aiding the Employer to secure business which will provide employment for persons in the bargaining unit. The Union, of course, will not discriminate between any Employers with which it has agreements.",
