        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Section 2.19 The Union agrees that its members in the employ of the Employer will perform efficient work and service. Inasmuch as foremen are covered by the Agreement, the Union agrees that its foremen members will perform efficiently as foremen, in the best interest of the Employer. Only qualified journeyman lineman may be foremen, if available. Also, the Union agrees that its members in the employ of the Employers will use their best endeavors to protect the property of the Employer.",
